<title>NETHERLANDS: Wegener details 1996 stock dividend.</title>
<headline>Wegener details 1996 stock dividend.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1997-05-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Dutch publisher and multimedia group Wegener NV said on Friday it had set its final 1996 alternative stock dividend at one new share per 53 held.</p>
<p>In March, Wegener announced it would pay a 1996 cash dividend of 3.65 guilders. Payment day for the cash dividend was May 14, while pay-out of the stock dividend has been set for May 23.</p>
<p>Wegener shares closed at 198.00 guilders on the Amsterdam Stock Exchange on Friday, up 4.40 guilders from their previous close.</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000 (fax +31 20 504 5040)</p>
